@startuml 09-diagnostics
!pragma layout smetana
' 装载诊断数据流与所有权；静态检查目录见 10-static-checks。
' 来源：GameData/ast/parse_diagnostic.h, GameProc/era_parse_table.cpp

title GameData/ast：装载诊断

package "GameData/ast" {
  class ParseDiagnostics {
    + add(diagnostic)
    + replaceOrigin(origin, sink)
    + removeOriginFiles(origin, files)
    + clear()
    + items() : QList<ParseDiagnostic>
  }
  struct ParseDiagnostic {
    + code : DiagCode
    + severity : Severity
    + origin : DiagOrigin
    + file : QString
    + line : int
    + message : QString
  }
  enum DiagOrigin {
    Preprocess
    Pass1
    Pass2
    Pass3
    Pass4
    Pass5
    Pass6
    Pass7
  }
}

package "GameProc" {
  class EraParseTable {
    + runCheckStructures()
    + runCheckStaticValues()
    + resolveStaticTargets()
    + diagnostics() : ParseDiagnostics
  }
  class "loadpass / parsecheck" as Pass
}

EraParseTable *-- ParseDiagnostics
EraParseTable --> Pass : each pass gets a sink
Pass --> ParseDiagnostics : replaceOrigin(origin, sink)
ParseDiagnostics --> ParseDiagnostic

note right of ParseDiagnostics
  Diagnostics are facts owned by the loading table.
  A rerun replaces the pass slice, so stale results cannot
  survive a repeated check. Runtime errors are reported through
  GameProc/EraEngine and do not enter these load slices.
end note

legend bottom
  This diagram describes ownership and flow only.
  The content of each check is 10-static-checks.
endlegend
@enduml
